<p><span>Keywords</span>: 1, 2-dichloroethane (1, 2-DCE), cytochrome P450 2E1 (CYP2E1), brain edema, diallyl sulfide (DAS), nuclear factor erythroid 2-related factor 2 (Nrf2), heme oxygenase-1 (HO-1)</p>
