ubMed Abstract\u003C/a> | \u003Ca href=\"https://doi.org/10.3390/toxins7041102\" target=\"_blank\">CrossRef Full Text\u003C/a> | \u003Ca href=\"http://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?&#x0026;title=Alteration+in+the+expression+of+cytochrome+P450s+%28CYP1A1%2C+CYP2E1%2C+and+CYP3A11%29+in+the+liver+of+mouse+induced+by+microcystin-LR%2E&#x0026;journal=Toxins&#x0026;author=Zhang+B.&#x0026;author=Liu+Y.&#x0026;author=and+Li+X.&#x0026;publication_year=2015&#x0026;volume=7&#x0026;pages=1102-1115\" target=\"_blank\">Google Scholar\u003C/a>\u003C/p>\r\n\u003C/div>\r\n\u003Cdiv class=\"References\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.5em;\">\r\n\u003Cp class=\"ReferencesCopy1\">\u003Ca name=\"B39\" id=\"B39\">\u003C/a>Zhong, Y., Dong, G., Luo, H., Cao, J., Wang, C., Wu, J., et al. (2012). Induction of brain CYP2E1 by chronic ethanol treatment and related oxidative stress in hippocampus, cerebellum, and brainstem. \u003Ci>Toxicology\u003C/i> 302, 275&#x2013;284. doi: 10.1016/j.tox.2012.08.009\u003C/p>\r\n\u003Cp class=\"ReferencesCopy2\">\u003Ca href=\"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/sites/entrez?Db=pubmed&#x0026;Cmd=ShowDetailView&#x0026;TermToSearch=22960445\" target=\"_blank\">PubMed Abstract\u003C/a> | \u003Ca href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.tox.2012.08.009\" target=\"_blank\">CrossRef Full Text\u003C/a> | \u003Ca href=\"http://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?&#x0026;title=Induction+of+brain+CYP2E1+by+chronic+ethanol+treatment+and+related+oxidative+stress+in+hippocampus%2C+cerebellum%2C+and+brainstem%2E&#x0026;journal=Toxicology&#x0026;author=Zhong+Y.&#x0026;author=Dong+G.&#x0026;author=Luo+H.&#x0026;author=Cao+J.&#x0026;author=Wang+C.&#x0026;author=Wu+J.&#x0026;publication_year=2012&#x0026;volume=302&#x0026;pages=275-284\" target=\"_blank\">Google Scholar\u003C/a>\u003C/p>\r\n\u003C/div>\r\n\u003Cdiv class=\"References\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.5em;\">\r\n\u003Cp class=\"ReferencesCopy1\">\u003Ca name=\"B40\" id=\"B40\">\u003C/a>Zhou, X., Zhou, W., Zhou, J., Long, L., and Xiao, B. (2015). 1,2-Dichloroethane-induced toxic leukoencephalopathy with a brain biopsy. \u003Ci>Neurol. Sci.\u003C/i> 36, 817&#x2013;819. doi: 10.1007/s10072-014-1949-1944\u003C/p>\r\n\u003Cp class=\"ReferencesCopy2\">\u003Ca href=\"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/sites/entrez?Db=pubmed&#x0026;Cmd=ShowDetailView&#x0026;TermToSearch=25217108\" target=\"_blank\">PubMed Abstract\u003C/a> | \u003Ca href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10072-014-1949-1944\" target=\"_blank\">CrossRef Full Text\u003C/a> | \u003Ca href=\"http://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?&#x0026;title=1%2C2-Dichloroethane-induced+toxic+leukoencephalopathy+with+a+brain+biopsy%2E&#x0026;journal=Neurol%2E+Sci%2E&#x0026;author=Zhou+X.&#x0026;author=Zhou+W.&#x0026;author=Zhou+J.&#x0026;author=Long+L.&#x0026;author=and+Xiao+B.&#x0026;publication_year=2015&#x0026;volume=36&#x0026;pages=817-819\" target=\"_blank\">Google Scholar\u003C/a>\u003C/p>\r\n\u003C/div>\r\n\u003Cdiv class=\"References\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.5em;\">\r\n\u003Cp class=\"ReferencesCopy1\">\u003Ca name=\"B41\" id=\"B41\">\u003C/a>Zimatkin, S. M., Pronko, S. P., Vasiliou, V., Gonzalez, F. J., and Deitrich, R. A. (2006). Enzymatic mechanisms of ethanol oxidation in the brain. \u003Ci>Alcohol Clin. Exp. Res.\u003C/i> 30, 1500&#x2013;1505. doi: 10.1111/j.1530-0277.2006.00181.x\u003C/p>\r\n\u003Cp class=\"ReferencesCopy2\">\u003Ca href=\"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/sites/entrez?Db=pubmed&#x0026;Cmd=ShowDetailView&#x0026;TermToSearch=16930212\" target=\"_blank\">PubMed Abstract\u003C/a> | \u003Ca href=\"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1530-0277.2006.00181.x\" target=\"_blank\">CrossRef Full Text\u003C/a> | \u003Ca href=\"http://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?&#x0026;title=Enzymatic+mechanisms+of+ethanol+oxidation+in+the+brain%2E&#x0026;journal=Alcohol+Clin%2E+Exp%2E+Res%2E&#x0026;author=Zimatkin+S.+M.&#x0026;author=Pronko+S.+P.&#x0026;author=Vasiliou+V.&#x0026;author=Gonzalez+F.+J.&#x0026;author=and+Deitrich+R.++A.&#x0026;publication_year=2006&#x0026;volume=30&#x0026;pages=1500-1505\" target=\"_blank\">Google Scholar\u003C/a>\u003C/p>\r\n\u003C/div>\r\n\u003C/div>\r\n\u003Cdiv class=\"thinLineM20\">\u003C/div>\r\n\u003Cdiv class=\"AbstractSummary\">\r\n\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>Keywords\u003C/span>: 1, 2-dichloroethane (1, 2-DCE), cytochrome P450 2E1 (CYP2E1), brain edema, diallyl sulfide (DAS), nuclear factor erythroid 2-related factor 2 (Nrf2), heme oxygenase-1 (HO-1)\u003C/p>\r\n\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>Citation:\u003C/span> Jin X, Liao Y, Tan X, Wang G, Zhao F and Jin Y (2018) Involvement of CYP2E1 in the Course of Brain Edema Induced by Subacute Poisoning With 1,2-Dichloroethane in Mice. \u003Ci>Front. Pharmacol.\u003C/i> 9:1317. doi: 10.3389/fphar.2018.01317\u003C/p>\r\n\u003Cp id=\"timestamps\">\r\n\u003Cspan>Received:\u003C/span> 05 June 2018; \u003Cspan>Accepted:\u003C/span> 29 October 2018;\u003Cbr>\u003Cspan>Published:\u003C/span> 15 November 2018.\u003C/p>\r\n\u003Cdiv>\r\n\u003Cp>Edited by:\u003C/p>\r\n\u003Ca href=\"https://loop.frontiersin.org/people/75206/overview\">Eleonore Fr&#x00F6;hlich\u003C/a>, Medical University of Graz, Austria\u003C/div>\r\n\u003Cdiv>\r\n\u003Cp>Reviewed by:\u003C/p>\r\n\u003Ca href=\"https://loop.frontiersin.org/people/14622/overview\">Marina Evans\u003C/a>, United States Environmental Protection Agency (EPA), United States\u003Cbr>\r\n\u003Ca href=\"https://loop.frontiersin.org/people/621417/overview\">Junwen Li\u003C/a>, Tianjin Institute of Health and Environmental Medicine, China\u003C/div>\r\n\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>Copyright\u003C/span> &#x00A9; 2018 Jin, Liao, Tan, Wang, Zhao and Jin. This is an open-access article distributed under the terms of the \u003Ca rel=\"license\" href=\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\">Creative Commons Attribution License (CC BY)\u003C/a>. The use, distribution or reproduction in other forums is permitted, provided the original author(s) and the copyright owner(s) are credited and that the original publication in this journal is cited, in accordance with accepted academic practice. No use, distribution or reproduction is permitted which does not comply with these terms.\u003C/p>\r\n\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>*Correspondence:\u003C/span> Yaping Jin, \u003Ca id=\"encmail\">amlueXBAbWFpbC5jbXUuZWR1LmNu\u003C/a>; \u003Ca id=\"encmail\">eXBqaW5AY211LmVkdS5jbg==\u003C/a>\u003C/p>\r\n\u003Cdiv class=\"clear\">\u003C/div>\r\n\u003C/div>","\u003Cul class=\"flyoutJournal\">\r\n\u003Cli>\u003Ca href=\"#h1\">Abstract\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\r\n\u003Cli>\u003Ca href=\"#h2\">Introduction\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\r\n\u003Cli>\u003Ca href=\"#h3\">Materials and Methods\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\r\n\u003Cli>\u003Ca href=\"#h4\">Results\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\r\n\u003Cli>\u003Ca href=\"#h5\">Discussion\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\r\n\u003Cli>\u003Ca href=\"#h6\">Author Contributions\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\r\n\u003Cli>\u003Ca href=\"#h7\">Funding\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\r\n\u003Cli>\u003Ca href=\"#h8\">Conflict of Interest Statement\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\r\n\u003Cli>\u003Ca href=\"#h9\">References\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\r\n\u003C/ul>\r\n",[577,582,588,591,597],{"name":578,"fileServerPackageEntryId":19,"fileServerId":579,"fileServerVersionNumber":374,"type":580},"EPUB.epub","385724/epub",{"code":581,"name":581},"EPUB",{"name":583,"fileServerPackageEntryId":584,"fileServerId":585,"fileServerVersionNumber":374,"type":586},"fphar-09-01317.pdf","fphar-09-01317/fphar-09-01317.pdf","385724/pubmed-zip",{"code":587,"name":587},"PDF",{"name":583,"fileServerPackageEntryId":19,"fileServerId":589,"fileServerVersionNumber":374,"type":590},"385724/publishers-proof/pdf",{"code":587,"name":587},{"name":592,"fileServerPackageEntryId":593,"fileServerId":585,"fileServerVersionNumber":374,"type":594},"fphar-09-01317.xml","fphar-09-01317/fphar-09-01317.xml",{"code":595,"name":596},"NLM_XML","XML",{"name":598,"fileServerPackageEntryId":19,"fileServerId":599,"fileServerVersionNumber":374,"type":600},"Provisional PDF.pdf","385724/provisional-pdf",{"code":587,"name":587},"v3",{"title":603,"li